	quest.2B56465BF07E4B0D.quest_desc: [
		"A mechanical mixer is essential in most create recipes."
		""
		"Using a mixer you can craft andesite alloy easier using only one andesite and one iron/zinc nugget instead of two of each item."
	]
	quest.2B56465BF07E4B0D.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Mechanical Mixer"
	quest.2BA42393C0984B10.quest_subtitle: "IV Increasing"
	quest.2FC4FE80D4F36806.quest_desc: [
		"The water wheel is the first option for SU as it is easy to acquire, but produce's the lowest RPM out of all the other options. "
		""
		"To get the SU from them you need to place flowing water under them to allow them to rotate to produce the rotational force. "
		""
		"You can stack water wheels together in a line to have the SU of each one added to each other. (ex. one water wheels gives 256 SU, place a second water wheel directly on the other and your SU goes to 512 as long they both have flowing water to power them)"
	]
	quest.2FC4FE80D4F36806.quest_subtitle: "Craft Water Wheels"
	quest.2FC4FE80D4F36806.title: "Water Wheels"
	quest.30237B920DB52654.quest_desc: [
		"A encased fan is how you would use create mechanics to do what a furnace would do and more."
		""
		"Using a fan you can blast smelt, wash, dye items, sand, and so much more."
	]
	quest.30237B920DB52654.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Encased Fan"
	quest.3120EC6B8C24EF72.quest_subtitle: "Much needed!"
