	quest.5D14466A5BF0BD3C.quest_desc: ["To craft cogs you need to acquire some shafts and any form of wooden planks. To make the small cog you put a shaft and plank beside each other in a crafting grid, to make the large cog you simply do the same but place another plank under the first plank in the grid."]
